				<string>Shortcuts generated by Shortcuts Playground. May contain mistakes. Always check the shortcut's actions first.

This shortcut was created from the following build objective:

&gt; A user can import the Shortcut, run it manually for the first time, and get a working state file plus a fully instructive Control Room note - and every subsequent invocation routes correctly and never corrupts or duplicates that foundation.

The next two actions are pinned in place: the import questions below are matched to their target actions by position in the list, not by name, so nothing may be inserted before them. A third import question, for on-device intelligence, belongs to a later build and is not part of this one.</string>
